{"sha": "cf35c5342b1487d2e76be132ace2f8b3b0885540959e1476d540e2d3b910e8f3", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:dipole-radiation} 章 --- 偶极辐射与散射}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:1}", "$p_0 = I_0\\ell/\\omega = \\qty{3.2e-9}{C.m}$; $E = \\mu_0\\omega^2p_0\\sin\\theta/4\\pi r$: \\qty{0.13}{V/m}", "在 $\\theta = 90^\\circ$ 时如上，\\qty{30}{\\degree} 时为 \\qty{0.063}{V/m}；$\\mathcal P = \\mu_0\\omega^4p_0^2/12\\pi c =", "\\qty{175}{W}$；$R_{\\text{辐射}} = 2\\mathcal P/I_0^2 = \\qty{88}{\\ohm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:2}", "$790(\\ell/\\lambda)^2$：\\qty{8.8e-5}{\\ohm}、\\qty{8.8e-3}{\\ohm}、\\qty{0.88}{\\ohm}、\\qty{88}{\\ohm}。铜：", "$0.026$、$0.084$、$0.27$、\\qty{0.84}{\\ohm}（趋肤深度）：效率分别为 $0.3\\%$、$10\\%$、", "$77\\%$、$99\\%$。波长很长时，只有高度占", "$\\lambda$ 相当大比例的桅杆，其辐射电阻才超过其损耗。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:3}", "$400 : 550 : 700 = 9.4 : 2.6 : 1$。$(10/3)^4 = 120$：\\qty{3}{cm} 雷达", "探测小水滴的效果好百倍；\\qty{10}{cm} 雷达", "则可穿过雨区，看到后方的目标。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:4}", "$\\sin^2\\chi/(1 + \\cos^2\\chi)$：$0.14$、$0.60$、$1$、$0.60$。观测点与太阳成", "\\qty{90}{\\degree} 角（天空中的一个大圆）；太阳位于头顶时，整个", "地平线处于 \\qty{90}{\\degree} 方向，并沿之偏振。多次散射、", "地面反射与分子各向异性共同贡献非偏振光，", "至多约 $75\\%$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:5}", "(a) $\\int\\sin^2\\theta\\,\\dd\\Omega = 8\\pi/3$. (b) $\\int_{60^\\circ}^{120^\\circ}\\sin^3\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta/", "(4/3) = 0.917/1.333 = 69\\%$。(c) $\\sin^2\\theta = \\tfrac12$：$\\theta = \\qty{45}{\\degree}$，一束", "光束宽 \\qty{90}{\\degree}。(d) 最大值 $1$ 与平均值 $2/3$ 之比为 $1.5$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:6}", "(a) $p/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^3 = \\omega^2p/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0c^2r$，在 $r_0 = c/\\omega = \\lambda/2\\pi$ 处。(b) \\qty{48}{m}：", "在 \\qty{10}{m} 处为准静态场，在 \\qty{10}{km} 处为辐射场。(c)", "$r_0 = \\qty{4.8}{cm}$：头部位于近区。(d) 近区中的 $\\vect E$", "与 $\\vect B$ 正交：坡印廷矢量的平均值为零，", "能量储存后又被返还，与电容器中的情形相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:7}", "(a) $8\\pi r_e^2/3 = \\qty{6.65e-29}{m^2}$. (b) $n_e\\sigma_TL = 10^{14} \\times 6.65 \\times 10^{-29}", "\\times 10^9 = 7 \\times 10^{-6}$：约为光球层的百万分之一，因汤姆孙散射本身", "无色，且被天空散射的阳光所淹没，", "除日食时外。(c) \\qty{10}{keV} $\\gg$ \\qty{300}{eV}：电子的响应如同", "自由电子，$6\\sigma_T = \\qty{4e-28}{m^2}$。(d) 光电吸收按 $Z^4$ 增长，", "并使钙尤为突出；散射对骨骼与", "软组织中每个电子的作用相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:8}", "(a) $\\tau = 0.36$, $0.10$, $0.038$: $T = 0.70$, $0.90$, $0.96$. (b) $\\tau \\times 38 = 13.6$,", "$3.8$、$1.45$：$T = 1 \\times 10^{-6}$、$0.02$、$0.23$；红光与蓝光之比 $\\sim 2 \\times 10^5$。(c)", "地球大气将日落时的光线弯入阴影区，", "并由同样的散射而变红。(d) 近地平线处光程很长：蓝光", "从散射光本身中被散射掉，多次散射又使", "光变白。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:9}", "(a) 沿这对天线的连线方向，光程差 $\\lambda/2$ 导致", "相消；侧向则相加。(b) 反相时情形相反 ---", "沿连线方向（端射）辐射，侧向无辐射。(c) 朝 $+x$ 方向：", "光程延迟 $-\\pi/2$ 加上馈电相位 $+\\pi/2$，同相；朝 $-x$ 方向：", "$-\\pi$，相消：呈心形，单侧辐射。(d) 天线桅杆决定覆盖范围", "并保护邻近设施；相控阵通过改变馈电", "相位来转向，只需微秒量级。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:10}", "(a) $\\langle\\mathcal P\\rangle = e^2\\omega_0^4x_0^2/12\\pi\\varepsilon_0c^3$, $W = \\tfrac12m\\omega_0^2x_0^2$:", "$\\Gamma = \\mathcal P/W = e^2\\omega_0^2/6\\pi\\varepsilon_0mc^3$. (b) $\\omega_0 = \\qty{3.2e15}{rad/s}$: $\\Gamma =", "\\qty{6.4e7}{s^{-1}}$ --- 即所用的值。(c) \\qty{16}{ns}；$\\Delta\\lambda = \\lambda^2\\Gamma/2\\pi c =", "\\qty{1.2e-14}{m}$，约为百分之一皮米（\\qty{10}{MHz}）。(d) $Q = 5 \\times 10^7$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:11}", "(a) \\qty{75}{m}; $I_0 = \\sqrt{2\\mathcal P/R} = \\qty{53}{A}$. (b) $\\langle\\Pi\\rangle = 1.5 \\times", "5 \\times 10^4/2\\pi \\times 10^8 = \\qty{1.2e-4}{W/m^2}$, $E_0 = \\sqrt{2\\Pi/\\varepsilon_0c} = \\qty{0.30}{V/m}$.", "(c) \\qty{0.30}{V}。(d) 回流电流在大地中流动；电阻性的", "土壤会增加损耗、破坏镜像作用；埋设的", "地网为其提供铜质通路。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:dipole-radiation:12}", "(a) 由 $p_0 = \\alpha E_0$ 得 $\\sigma = \\alpha^2\\omega^4/6\\pi\\varepsilon_0^2c^4$；其中 $\\alpha = \\varepsilon_0(n^2", "- 1)/N$，$\\omega = 2\\pi c/\\lambda$，于是 $\\sigma = 8\\pi^3(n^2 - 1)^2/3N^2\\lambda^4$。(b) $n^2 - 1 =", "5.8 \\times 10^{-4}$：$\\sigma = \\qty{4.9e-31}{m^2}$，平均自由程 $1/N\\sigma = \\qty{80}{km}$。(c)", "$8/80 = 0.1$。(d) $\\sigma$ 由天空的衰减测得，$n$ 已知，", "$N$ 随之确定，进而得阿伏伽德罗常数。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:dipole-radiation:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\lambda = \\qty{300}{m}$, $h = \\qty{75}{m}$; $I_0 = \\sqrt{2 \\times 10^5/36} = \\qty{75}{A}$;", "$V = RI_0 = \\qty{2.7}{kV}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\ell_{\\text{有效}} = \\qty{48}{m}$：$p_0 = 75 \\times 48/6.3 \\times 10^6 = \\qty{5.7e-4}{C.m}$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\langle\\Pi\\rangle = 1.5 \\times 10^5/2\\pi r^2$：\\qty{2.4e-4}{W/m^2} 与 \\qty{2.4e-6}{W/m^2}；", "$E_0 = \\qty{0.42}{V/m}$ 与 \\qty{0.042}{V/m}。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 鞭状天线：\\qty{42}{mV}。磁棒天线：$N\\mu_{\\text{有效}}A\\omega B_0 = 10^4 \\times 10^{-4} \\times 6.3 \\times", "10^6 \\times 1.4 \\times 10^{-10} = \\qty{0.9}{mV}$ --- 更小，但更紧凑、更具选择性。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $A = 1.5\\lambda^2/4\\pi = \\qty{1.1e4}{m^2}$: $P = \\Pi A = \\qty{26}{mW}$.", "", "\\textbf{6.} $36/38 = 95\\%$；\\qty{5}{kW} 的热量。", ""]}